tor properties to keep events away from the main-thread. Compositor properties are run on a separate compositor thread, freeing the main-thread for longer and improving your page load performance.<\\/p>\"},\"unsized-images\":{\"title\":\"Image elements do not have explicit `width` and `height`\",\"description\":\"Set an explicit width and height on image elements to reduce layout shifts and improve CLS. [Learn how to set image dimensions](https:\\/\\/web.dev\\/optimize-cls\\/#images-without-dimensions)\",\"score\":0,\"displayValue\":null,\"details\":[{\"node\":{\"type\":\"node\",\"path\":\"1,HTML,1,BODY,0,DIV,3,DIV,0,SECTION,3,DIV,0,DIV,1,DIV,0,DIV,1,DIV,0,SECTION,3,DIV,1,DIV,1,DIV,0,DIV,0,DIV,0,DIV,0,DIV,0,IMG\",\"nodeLabel\":\"div.wp-block-gutenverse-team > div.profile-box > div.profile-card > img\",\"boundingRect\":{\"width\":540,\"right\":1235,\"height\":809,\"bottom\":2984,\"left\":695,\"top\":2175},\"snippet\":\"<img src=\\\"https:\\/\\/nparksf.cluster027.hosting.ovh.net\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/11\\/phot\\u2026\\\" alt=\\\"\\\">\",\"selector\":\"div.wp-block-gutenverse-team > div.profile-box > div.profile-card > img\",\"lhId\":\"1-11-IMG\"},\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/nparksf.cluster027.hosting.ovh.net\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/11\\/photo-de-portraits-en-noir-et-blancportrait-noie-et-blanc_7089.jpg\"},{\"node\":{\"lhId\":\"1-10-IMG\",\"selector\":\"div.wp-block-gutenverse-team > div.profile-box > div.profile-card > img\",\"type\":\"node\",\"path\":\"1,HTML,1,BODY,0,DIV,3,DIV,0,SECTION,3,DIV,0,DIV,1,DIV,0,DIV,1,DIV,0,SECTION,3,DIV,0,DIV,1,DIV,0,DIV,0,DIV,0,DIV,0,DIV,0,IMG\",\"nodeLabel\":\"div.wp-block-gutenverse-team > div.profile-box > div.profile-card > img\",\"snippet\":\"<img src=\\\"https:\\/\\/nparksf.cluster027.hosting.ovh.net\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/11\\/conc\\u2026\\\" alt=\\\"\\\">\",\"boundingRect\":{\"height\":0,\"top\":2193,\"right\":665,\"width\":540,\"left\":125,\"bottom\":2193}},\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/nparksf.cluster027.hosting.ovh.net\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2023\\/11\\/concert-rock-musique-groupeIMG_0202-Modifier.jpg\"}],\"type\":[\"CLS\"],\"instructions\":\"<p>To fix this audit, simply specify, both, the width and height for your webpage&#039;s image and video elements. This ensures that the correct spacing is used for images and videos.<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p>For example:<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<code>&lt;img src=&quot;image.jpg&quot; width=&quot;640&quot; height=&quot;360&quot; alt=&quot;image&quot;&gt;<\\/code>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p>Where width and height have been declared as 640 and 360 pixels respectively.<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p>Note that modern browsers automatically calculate the aspect ratio for an image\\/video based on the declared width and height attributes.<\\/p>\"},\"viewport\":{\"title\":\"Has a `<meta name=\\\"viewport\\\">` tag with `width` or `initial-scale`\",\"description\":\"A `<meta name=\\\"viewport\\\">` not only optimizes your app for mobile screen sizes, but also prevents [a 300 millisecond delay to user input](https:\\/\\/developer.chrome.com\\/blog\\/300ms-tap-delay-gone-away\\/). [Learn more about using the viewport meta tag](https:\\/\\/developer.chrome.com\\/docs\\/lighthouse\\/pwa\\/viewport\\/).\",\"score\":1,\"displayValue\":null,\"details\":null,\"type\":[\"TBT\"],\"instructions\":\"<p>Use the &quot;viewport&quot; &lt;meta&gt; tag to control the viewport&#039;s size and shape form mobile friendly website:<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<code>&lt;meta name=&quot;viewport&quot; content=&quot;width=device-width, initial-scale=1&quot;&gt;<\\/code>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p>More details <a target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/developer.mozilla.org\\/en-US\\/docs\\/Web\\/HTML\\/Viewport_meta_tag\\\">ici<\\/a>.<\\/p>\"}},\"diagnostics\":{\"font-display\":{\"title\":\"All text remains visible during webfont loads\",\"description\":\"Leverage the `font-display` CSS feature to ensure text is user-visible while webfonts are loading. [Learn more about `font-display`](https:\\/\\/developer.chrome.com\\/docs\\/lighthouse\\/performance\\/font-display\\/).\",\"score\":1,\"displayValue\":null,\"details\":[],\"type\":[\"FCP\",\"LCP\"],\"instructions\":\"<p>It&#039;s advisable to host the fonts on the server instead of using Google CDN<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p>Preload fonts with a plugin or manually:<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<br\\/>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<code>&lt;link rel=&quot;preload&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; href=&quot;\\/webfontname&quot; as=&quot;font&quot; type=&quot;font\\/format&quot; crossorigin&gt;<\\/code>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<br\\/>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p>Use font-display atribute: The font-display attribute determines how the font is displayed during your page load, based on whether it has been downloaded and is ready for use.<\\/p>\"},\"first-contentful-paint-3g\":{\"title\":null,\"description\":null,\"score\":null,\"displayValue\":null,\"details\":null,\"instructions\":\"<p>Enable Page Cache using the fastest engine.<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p>What it represents: How much is visible at a time during load.<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p>Lighthouse Performance score weighting: 10%<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p>What it measures: The Speed Index is the average time at which visible parts of the page are displayed.<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p>How it&#039;s measured: Lighthouse&#039;s Speed Index measurement comes from a node module called Speedline.<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p>In order for content to be displayed to the user, the browser must first download, parse, and process all external stylesheets it encounters before it can display or render any content to a user&#039;s screen.<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p>The fastest way to bypass the delay of external resources is to use in-line styles for above-the-fold content.<\\/p>\"},\"uses-long-cache-ttl\":{\"title\":\"Uses efficient cache policy on static assets\",\"description\":\"A long cache lifetime can speed up repeat visits to your page. [Learn more about efficient cache policies](https:\\/\\/developer.chrome.com\\/docs\\/lighthouse\\/performance\\/uses-long-cache-ttl\\/).\",\"score\":1,\"displayValue\":\"0 resources found\",\"details\":[],\"instructions\":\"<p>Use <a target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/nparksf.cluster027.hosting.ovh.net\\/wp-admin\\/admin.php?page=w3tc_general#browser_cache\\\" alt=\\\"Mise en cache navigateur\\\">Browser Caching<\\/a> in W3 Total Cache and set the Expires header and cache control header for static files and HTML.<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p>Use default values for best results<\\/p>\"},\"critical-request-chains\":{\"title\":\"Avoid chaining critical requests\",\"description\":\"The Critical Request Chains below show you what resources are loaded with a high priority. Consider reducing the length of chains, reducing the download size of resources, or deferring the download of unnecessary resources to improve page load. [Learn how to avoid chaining critical requests](https:\\/\\/developer.chrome.com\\/docs\\/lighthouse\\/performance\\/critical-request-chains\\/).\",\"score\":null,\"displayValue\":\"27 chains found\",\"details\":null,\"type\":[\"FCP\",\"LCP\"],\"instructions\":\"<p>Eliminate Render Blocking CSS and apply asynchronous loading where applicable. Additionally, image optimization by way of resizing, lazy loaidng, and webp conversion can impact this metric as well.<\\/p>\"},\"resource-summary\":{\"title\":null,\"description\":null,\"score\":null,\"displayValue\":null,\"details\":null,\"instructions\":\"<p>Actions that can help:<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<ul>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li>Avoid multiple page redirects.<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li>Combine images using CSS sprites.<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li>Remove unnecessary third-party scripts.<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li>Compress your text resources.<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/ul>\"},\"largest-contentful-paint-element\":{\"title\":\"Largest Contentful Paint element\",\"description\":\"This is the largest contentful element painted within the viewport. [Learn more about the Largest Contentful Paint element](https:\\/\\/developer.chrome.com\\/docs\\/lighthouse\\/performance\\/lighthouse-largest-contentful-paint\\/)\",\"score\":null,\"displayValue\":\"3,710\\u00a0ms\",\"details\":[{\"items\":[{\"node\":{\"nodeLabel\":\"Photographier c\\u2019est l\\u2019art d\\u2019aligner la tete l\\u2019\\u0153il et le coeur\\n\\nLe temps d\\u2019une p\\u2026\",\"path\":\"1,HTML,1,BODY,0,DIV,1,DIV,0,SECTION\",\"boundingRect\":{\"left\":94,\"top\":166,\"bottom\":1157,\"width\":1162,\"right\":1256,\"height\":992},\"lhId\":\"page-0-SECTION\",\"snippet\":\"<section class=\\\"wp-block-gutenverse-section guten-element guten-section guten-P6sVWZ layou\\u2026\\\">\",\"type\":\"node\",\"selector\":\"body.home > div.wp-site-blocks > div.section-wrapper > section.wp-block-gutenverse-section\"}}],\"type\":\"table\",\"headings\":[{\"valueType\":\"node\",\"label\":\"Element\",\"key\":\"node\"}]},{\"items\":[{\"phase\":\"TTFB\",\"timing\":173,\"percent\":\"5%\"},{\"phase\":\"Load Delay\",\"percent\":\"56%\",\"timing\":2075.977917632514},{\"percent\":\"9%\",\"phase\":\"Load Time\",\"timing\":332.6575347605508},{\"phase\":\"Render Delay\",\"percent\":\"30%\",\"timing\":1124.864547606935}],\"headings\":[{\"key\":\"phase\",\"label\":\"Phase\",\"valueType\":\"text\"},{\"valueType\":\"text\",\"label\":\"% of LCP\",\"key\":\"percent\"},{\"key\":\"timing\",\"valueType\":\"ms\",\"label\":\"Timing\"}],\"type\":\"table\"}],\"type\":[\"LCP\"],\"instructions\":\"<p>How To Fix Poor LCP<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<br\\/>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p>If the cause is slow server response time:<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<ul>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li>Optimize your server.<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li>Route users to a nearby CDN.<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li>Cache assets.<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li>Serve HTML pages cache-first.<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li>Establish third-party connections early.<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/ul>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<br\\/>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p>If the cause is render-blocking JavaScript and CSS:<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<ul>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li>Minify CSS.<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li>Defer non-critical CSS.<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li>Inline critical CSS.<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li>Minify and compress JavaScript files.<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li>Defer unused JavaScript.<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li>Minimize unused polyfills.<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/ul>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<br\\/>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p>If the cause is resource load times:<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<ul>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li>Optimize and compress images.<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li>Preload important resources.<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li>Compress text files.<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li>Deliver different assets based on the network connection (adaptive serving).<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li>Cache assets using a service worker.<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/ul>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<br\\/>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p>If the cause is client-side rendering:<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<ul>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li>Minimize critical JavaScript.<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li>Use another rendering strategy.<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/ul>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<br\\/>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p>W3 Total Cache Features that will help performace of the above:<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<ul>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/nparksf.cluster027.hosting.ovh.net\\/wp-admin\\/admin.php?page=w3tc_general#minify\\\" alt=\\\"Minifier\\\">Minifier<\\/a><\\/li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/nparksf.cluster027.hosting.ovh.net\\/wp-admin\\/admin.php?page=w3tc_general#page_cache\\\" alt=\\\"Mise en cache de page\\\">Mise en cache de page<\\/a><\\/li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/nparksf.cluster027.hosting.ovh.net\\/wp-admin\\/admin.php?page=w3tc_general#browser_cache\\\" alt=\\\"Mise en cache navigateur\\\">Mise en cache navigateur<\\/a><\\/li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/nparksf.cluster027.hosting.ovh.net\\/wp-admin\\/admin.php?page=w3tc_general#cdn\\\" alt=\\\"CDN\\\">CDN<\\/a><\\/li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/ul>\"},\"layout-shift-elements\":{\"title\":\"Avoid large layout shifts\",\"description\":\"These DOM elements contribute most to the CLS of the page. [Learn how to improve CLS](https:\\/\\/web.dev\\/optimize-cls\\/)\",\"score\":null,\"displayValue\":\"1 element found\",\"details\":[{\"node\":{\"selector\":\"div.wp-block-gutenverse-column > div.sticky-wrapper > div.guten-column-wrapper > div.guten-element\",\"path\":\"1,HTML,1,BODY,0,DIV,1,DIV,0,SECTION,3,DIV,0,DIV,1,DIV,0,DIV,2,DIV\",\"type\":\"node\",\"snippet\":\"<div class=\\\"guten-element guten-button-wrapper guten-BTgZlT\\\">\",\"nodeLabel\":\"div.wp-block-gutenverse-column > div.sticky-wrapper > div.guten-column-wrapper > div.guten-element\",\"lhId\":\"page-1-DIV\",\"boundingRect\":{\"top\":873,\"right\":723,\"width\":526,\"left\":198,\"bottom\":927,\"height\":54}},\"score\":0.0025815602836879435}],\"type\":[\"CLS\"],\"instructions\":\"<p>Without completely redesigning your web page from scratch, typically you cannot resolve this warning.  Understand that this warning is significant and if you get it for more than one or two pages in your site, you should consider:<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<br\\/>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<ul>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li>Reducing the amount of widgets \\/ sections within your web pages or page layouts<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li>Using a simpler web page builder as many page builders add a lot of code bloat<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li>Using a different theme<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li>Using a different slider<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/ul>\"},\"long-tasks\":{\"title\":\"Avoid long main-thread tasks\",\"description\":\"Lists the longest tasks on the main thread, useful for identifying worst contributors to input delay. [Learn how to avoid long main-thread tasks](https:\\/\\/web.dev\\/long-tasks-devtools\\/)\",\"score\":null,\"displayValue\":\"6 long tasks found\",\"details\":[{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.googletagmanager.com\\/gtag\\/js?id=GT-TBWL8J6\",\"duration\":87,\"startTime\":867},{\"duration\":86,\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/pagead2.googlesyndication.com\\/pagead\\/js\\/adsbygoogle.js?client=ca-pub-4967825192801358&host=ca-host-pub-2644536267352236\",\"startTime\":711},{\"startTime\":1380,\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/pagead2.googlesyndication.com\\/pagead\\/managed\\/js\\/adsense\\/m202311090101\\/show_ads_impl_with_ama_fy2021.js?client=ca-pub-4967825192801358&plah=nparksf.cluster027.hosting.ovh.net\",\"duration\":73},{\"duration\":72,\"url\":\"_lighthouse-eval.js\",\"startTime\":5303},{\"startTime\":1314,\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.googletagmanager.com\\/gtag\\/js?id=G-TJ8HCCS4KS&l=dataLayer&cx=c\",\"duration\":66},{\"startTime\":4647,\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/nparksf.cluster027.hosting.ovh.net\\/wp-includes\\/js\\/dist\\/hooks.min.js?ver=c6aec9a8d4e5a5d543a1\",\"duration\":54}],\"type\":[\"TBT\"],\"instructions\":\"<p>Optimizing third-party JavaScript<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<br\\/>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<ul>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li>Review your website&#039;s third-party code and remove the ones that aren&#039;t adding any value to your website.<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/ul>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<br\\/>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p>Debouncing your input handlers<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<ul>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li>Avoid using long-running input handlers (which may block scrolling) and do not make style changes in input handlers (which is likely to cause repainting of pixels).<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/ul>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<br\\/>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p>Debouncing your input handlers helps solve both of the above problems.<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<br\\/>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p>Delay 3rd-party JS<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<ul>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li>Reducing JavaScript execution time<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li>Reduce your JavaScript payload by implementing code splitting, minifying and compressing your JavaScript code, removing unused code, and following the PRPL pattern. (Use W3 Total Cache <a target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/nparksf.cluster027.hosting.ovh.net\\/wp-admin\\/admin.php?page=w3tc_minify#js\\\" alt=\\\"Minify JS\\\">Minify for JS<\\/a> and compression.) Use <a target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/nparksf.cluster027.hosting.ovh.net\\/wp-admin\\/admin.php?page=w3tc_general#cdn\\\" alt=\\\"CDN\\\">CDN<\\/a> and HTTP2 Push if available on server.<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/ul>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<br\\/>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p>Only using compositor properties<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<ul>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li>Stick to using compositor properties to keep events away from the main-thread. Compositor properties are run on a separate compositor thread, freeing the main-thread for longer and improving your page load performance.<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/ul>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/ul>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<br\\/>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p>Reducing CSS parsing time<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<ul>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li>Reduce the time spent parsing CSS by minifying, or deferring non-critical CSS, or removing unused CSS. (Use W3 Total Cache <a target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/nparksf.cluster027.hosting.ovh.net\\/wp-admin\\/admin.php?page=w3tc_minify#css\\\" alt=\\\"Minify CSS\\\">Minify for CSS<\\/a> and compression.) Use <a target=\\\"_blank\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/nparksf.cluster027.hosting.ovh.net\\/wp-admin\\/admin.php?page=w3tc_general#cdn\\\" alt=\\\"CDN\\\">CDN<\\/a> and HTTP2 Push if available on server.<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/ul>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<br\\/>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<p>Only using compositor properties<\\/p>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<ul>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li>Stick to using compositor properties to keep events away from the main-thread. Compositor properties are run on a separate compositor thread, freeing the main-thread for longer and improving your page load performance.<\\/li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/ul>\"}}},\"test_url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.googleapis.com\\/pagespeedonline\\/v5\\/runPagespeed?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnparksf.cluster027.hosting.ovh.net\",\"time\":1701179660,\"display_time\":\"Nov 28th, 2023 2:54pm\"}', 'yes');
